*LTspice
*
*MAX4766C
*0.075A to 1.5A, Programmable Current-Limit Switch
*AE01015766
*
*netlist
.include MAX4766C.cir
*
*params
.param RPU=5K
.param RLOAD1=20
.param RLOAD2=20
.param COUT=2.2u
.param CSETB=0.075u
.param CSETS=1u
.param RSETI=562.5K
*
.param VSOURCE=3.3
*
*transient response
.tran 0 25000m 0
*
*.backanno
*.op
